                <p source="#source-496395-496475"><seg source="#source-496395-496437">東京都新宿区下落合一ノ三六九</seg><seg type="layout" source="#source-496437-496475" rend="chitsuki align(right) offset-from-end(0)" snh:layout-kind="chitsuki" snh:layout-params="align=right;offset-from-end=0"><seg source="#source-496455-496475">村田モト子氏</seg></seg></p>
