                <p source="#source-496591-496662"><seg source="#source-496591-496627">東京都目黒区洗足一四六三</seg><seg type="layout" source="#source-496627-496662" rend="chitsuki align(right) offset-from-end(0)" snh:layout-kind="chitsuki" snh:layout-params="align=right;offset-from-end=0"><seg source="#source-496645-496662">大井広介氏</seg></seg></p>
